    emit()
    emit("   Note: prod wave limits are surface-anchored (sprc minus edge), so a large "
         "positive sprc-cross means the limit is priced off a surface the book is not "
         "showing -- the documented wave-1 no-fill mechanism "
         "(eod_option_algos/README.md, 'sprc-vs-cross divergence as a wave-1 fill signal').")


